"text": "For your New Year's evening at the restaurant, I have gathered a sophisticated and warm ensemble. The outfit features a light grey woolen double-breasted coat with an English lapel to keep you stylish yet protected against the frost. Underneath, graphite trousers offer a clean line for your defined waist, paired with a matching graphite blazer that adds structure without being too heavy. A milky cashmere scarf brings a soft texture and subtle warmth, while a burgundy handbag introduces a rich accent color. Chocolate ankle boots complete the look, providing both height and comfort for a formal setting.",
"how_to_wear": [
"Wear the blazer underneath your coat to create a layered silhouette that remains warm against the frost.",
"Drape the milky scarf around your neck or over your shoulders to add a touch of texture near your face.",
"Hold the burgundy bag in one hand to balance the double-breasted coat and draw attention to your waist."
],
